{
  "source": "Prompts/big-upside-v11.mp4",
  "duration": 212.5013125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.16,
      "text": "We hear a lot about artificial intelligence, but at its core, AI is essentially a giant calculator."
    },
    {
      "start": 7.02,
      "end": 10.56,
      "text": "It is a system running math at a scale that nobody can easily picture."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.18,
      "end": 14.52,
      "text": "But that calculator can do some amazing things right now."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.26,
      "end": 19.6,
      "text": "It can help scientists investigate diseases, assist doctors in finding cancer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 20.22,
      "end": 22.58,
      "text": "and help someone read a food label they couldn't read before."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.44,
      "end": 26.4,
      "text": "The big upside of this technology isn't a distant promise."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.9,
      "end": 27.98,
      "text": "It is already happening."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.98,
      "end": 31.7,
      "text": "Inside your body, proteins act as tiny machines."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.54,
      "end": 37.28,
      "text": "They do countless jobs, from carrying oxygen through your bloodstream to fighting off infections."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.28,
      "end": 42.42,
      "text": "The specific shape of a protein helps determine exactly what it does."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.12,
      "end": 47.38,
      "text": "Knowing a protein's shape can help scientists understand how a disease works,"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.82,
      "end": 49.54,
      "text": "and look for new medicines to treat it."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.2,
      "end": 56.48,
      "text": "But figuring out those complex shapes manually was a notoriously slow and difficult job for researchers."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.22,
      "end": 59.7,
      "text": "Alphafold AI changed the scale."
    },
    {
      "start": 60.56,
      "end": 66.14,
      "text": "Before, we had about 200,000 protein structures determined through decades of experiments."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.8,
      "end": 72.16,
      "text": "Now, there are over 200 million protein structures predicted and shared free."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.04,
      "end": 75.64,
      "text": "But remember, a prediction isn't a finished medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.72,
      "end": 79.14,
      "text": "Scientists still have to test ideas and do the research."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.92,
      "end": 81.82,
      "text": "We see similar acceleration in medicine."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.82,
      "end": 86.68,
      "text": "When doctors examine breast scans, they are looking for tiny visual signs"
    },
    {
      "start": 86.68,
      "end": 88.62,
      "text": "that can be incredibly difficult to spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.38,
      "end": 95.68,
      "text": "In a Swedish trial involving over 100,000 women, doctors using AI found more cancers"
    },
    {
      "start": 95.68,
      "end": 97.24,
      "text": "than those working without it."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.94,
      "end": 100.46,
      "text": "This graphic illustrates how that workflow functions."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.3,
      "end": 104.42,
      "text": "The AI highlights patterns in a scan that deserve a closer look."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.12,
      "end": 106.84,
      "text": "The system does not replace human judgment."
    },
    {
      "start": 107.5,
      "end": 110.9,
      "text": "Doctors examine the highlighted scan, apply their medical expertise,"
    },
    {
      "start": 110.9,
      "end": 112.72,
      "text": "and decide what care is needed."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.9,
      "end": 117.4,
      "text": "Now think about how often you read something without giving it a second thought."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.98,
      "end": 121.28,
      "text": "A menu at a restaurant, a food label at the store, or a street sign."
    },
    {
      "start": 121.72,
      "end": 124.3,
      "text": "For someone who is blind or has low vision,"
    },
    {
      "start": 124.78,
      "end": 128.04,
      "text": "accessing that everyday information can be a difficult barrier."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.0,
      "end": 130.88,
      "text": "This diagram shows a practical solution."
    },
    {
      "start": 131.52,
      "end": 135.16,
      "text": "A person points their phone camera to bring a menu or a food label into view."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.94,
      "end": 138.98,
      "text": "The AI recognizes the text on the object and reads it aloud."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.98,
      "end": 141.74,
      "text": "It can also describe the contents of photos."
    },
    {
      "start": 142.64,
      "end": 148.46,
      "text": "Making an everyday, ordinary task easier to navigate provides a profoundly meaningful benefit."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.16,
      "end": 151.7,
      "text": "AI is also providing crucial time."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.34,
      "end": 156.64,
      "text": "For any community sitting in a flood's path, time is the most valuable resource."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.4,
      "end": 161.56,
      "text": "AI helps provide free early warnings, and it is especially useful in regions"
    },
    {
      "start": 161.56,
      "end": 164.1,
      "text": "that lack physical equipment to measure river levels."
    },
    {
      "start": 164.1,
      "end": 169.42,
      "text": "As shown here, predictive modeling allows the AI to provide accurate flood warnings"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.42,
      "end": 170.7,
      "text": "days ahead of time."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.3,
      "end": 176.58,
      "text": "People get the time they need to prepare and move out of harm's way before the water arrives."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.14,
      "end": 182.94,
      "text": "What did these four distinct examples, investigating disease, finding cancer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 183.32,
      "end": 186.4,
      "text": "reading a label and preparing for a flood have in common?"
    },
    {
      "start": 187.26,
      "end": 190.98,
      "text": "In each case, computational power supports human effort."
    },
    {
      "start": 191.62,
      "end": 193.02,
      "text": "Scientists get a starting point."
    },
    {
      "start": 193.5,
      "end": 195.5,
      "text": "Doctors get help finding something important."
    },
    {
      "start": 196.2,
      "end": 197.72,
      "text": "People get access to information."
    },
    {
      "start": 198.38,
      "end": 199.82,
      "text": "Communities get time to prepare."
    },
    {
      "start": 200.66,
      "end": 202.66,
      "text": "These are making a difference in people's lives."
    },
    {
      "start": 203.94,
      "end": 205.4,
      "text": "The big upside is happening today."
    },
    {
      "start": 205.96,
      "end": 209.44,
      "text": "AI is already accelerating work that protects and improves lives."
    }
  ],
